            ["Where is the justice in the world when a strange mage comes to destroy our Temple and disrupt our peace?! Where is the keeper of the key?"];
            TurnOn(<< "justice", "strange mage", "disrupt", "keeper of the key", "accuse", "bye" >>);
            converse {
                key ("justice") {
                    TurnOff("justice");
                    ["Thou mayest call me Number 5, for I no longer bear a mortal name. I surrendered that when I swore myself to eternal service at the fountain of Logic."];
                    ["I am bound for all time and eternity in a body that will never age, and now I cannot fulfill my vows! Where is the justice in living forever with broken vows?"];
                }
                key ("strange mage") {
                    TurnOff("strange mage");
                    ["He was a rude, fat man, <v0>. I assumed he came seeking Logic, but I should have realized that one such as he would not be interested in the clarity of Logic."];
                }
                key ("disrupt") {
                    TurnOff("disrupt");
                    ["Long ago, the Order Hierophant bound a force of great evil into a prison and placed it here for us to guard."];
                    ["What peace is left for us here, guardians of an empty shell now that the mage hath loosed what once was captive?"];
                    TurnOn("force of great evil");
                }
                key ("force of great evil") {
                    TurnOff("force of great evil");
                    ["I do not know what it was, <v0>. I am sorry. It was not my place to ask if the Hierophant did not choose to tell me."];
                    ["I can only hope that the failure of my fellows and I hath not endangered the world too greatly."];
                }
                key ("keeper of the key") {
                    TurnOff("keeper of the key");
                    ["Perhaps the mage waylaid Number 7 to steal the key..."];
                    ["But no, that cannot be. For Number 7 disappeared the day I was with Number 3, long before the strange mage came."];
                }
                key ("accuse") {
                    ["I must warn thee, <v0>, we are each sworn to protect the other. If thou dost accuse me falsely, we shall attack thee."];
                    ["If thou hast spoken to each of us and hast determined that one of us is guilty, accuse accordingly. But be not hasty in thy judgment."];
                    ["Dost thou accuse me?"];
                    if ~AskYesNo() {
                        ["Lies! Number 3 will remember that we were together when Number 7 disappeared!"];
                        SayIfNear_i("@It is true, Number 5 was with me!@", 65440);
                        SetSpeakerSlot_i(0);
                        ["I shall have thine head for this outrage!"];
                        v2 = << 65442, 65441, 65440, 65439, 65438, 65437 >>;
                        Foreach v5 in v2 {
                            Npc_setAlignment(_Chaotic, v5);
                            SetWorkType(_Combat_0, v5);
                            SetAttacker_i(v5, _Avatar);
                        }
                        terminate;
                    } else {
